= [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionist Party</span>?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>?] Conference

# reference: Evans, Ellen L. “Adam Sedgewick and the Role of the Faithful Free Guilds in the Commonwealth.” The Faithful Historical Review 59, no. 4 (1974): 602–26.

Wilhelm Croft, former [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionist Party</span>?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>?] chancellor and presidential candidate, has chosen to resign from leadership of the [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionist Party</span>?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>?]. Now, the party holds a conference to replace him.

The consensus candidate on the right is Aurelian Renck, a priest of the Faithful who represents the party's traditionalists. On the other hand, there is Cormac Hawkins, a leader of the Faithful Free Guilds, who has been more supportive of cooperation with the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span> than most of the [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionist Party</span>?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>?]. [? if not heartland_leader == "Sedgewick": Faithful Free Guild chairman Adam Sedgewick has fallen to a distant third, making it highly unlikely that he will win the leadership.?][? if heartland_leader == "Sedgewick": Faithful Free Guild chairman and Minister-President Adam Sedgewick has lost some ground, but he retains strong support from the Heartland branch of the party, effectively securing him the nomination. ?]

- @kaas: The [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionist Party</span>?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>?] elects Aurelian Renck as the party chair.
- @joos: Influence the [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionist Party</span>?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>?] to select Cormac Hawkins as the party chair.
- @joos_campaign: We must hold a campaign in support of Cormac Hawkins as party chair.
- @stegerwald: The [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionist Party</span>?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>?] elects Adam Sedgewick as the party chair.

@kaas
view-if: not heartland_leader == "Sedgewick"
on-arrival: unionist_leader = "Renck"; unionist_relation -= 5; heartland_concordat_progress += 1; unionist_ideology = "Right"
